  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v4.2.0: Adds text-only BM25 search and configurable normalized weighted RRF. Applies filtering before candidate truncation and honors vector weight, candidate multiplier and RRF smoothing. Synchronizes records and keyword indexes across reads/writes, copies input/output records and observes cancellation while waiting and between batch records. Completed records remain consistent, but batch writes and sequential replacement are not transactional. Full notes: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/blob/main/src/vectordb/Mythosia.VectorDb.InMemory/RELEASE_NOTES.md#v420",
